  partName: Fuel Injector (2)
  description: The Fuel Injector (2) is another tiny, elongated fuel injector located
    at the top-center-center of the engine, which works in tandem with the first
    fuel injector to provide a balanced fuel supply. Constructed from Material.002,
    this part is vital for maintaining optimal engine performance, and its tiny size
    allows for precise fuel metering. Notably, the fuel injector's elongated shape
    enables it to be positioned close to the intake valves for improved fuel atomization.
